    - target: {fileID: 3610753184720269686, guid: 3357b2d8b9acaf640bf0107242fc597d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: "\"V\u1EADy th\xEC ta s\u1EBD t\xECm h\u1EAFn\u2026 v\xE0 k\u1EBFt th\xFAc
        chuy\u1EC7n n\xE0y \u0111\u1EC3 c\u1EE9u \u0111\u1EA5t n\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u1EE7a
        ta.\""
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3610753184720269686, guid: 3357b2d8b9acaf640bf0107242fc597d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[4]'
      value: "\"\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c th\xF4i, Nh\u01B0ng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc h\u1EBFt
        h\xE3y ch\u1EA1y kh\u1ECFi khu v\u1EF1c c\xF4 \u0111ang \u0111\u1EE9ng \u0111\xE3
